OL,3,GNEWSANew 20mph speed limits introduced
OL,4,Ain two villages
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeed limits have been reduced in two
OL,7,FFenland villages.
OL,9,FThe new 20mph restrictions affect
OL,10,FBegdale Road and Gosmoor Lane in Elm,
OL,11,Fas well as Maltmas Drove and Well End
OL,12,Fin Friday Bridge, Cambridgeshire.
OL,14,FRoad markings and signs were installed
OL,15,Fthis week to reflect the changes, with
OL,16,Fthe limit becoming enforceable once
OL,17,Fthey were in place.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
