OL,3,GNEWSANew 20mph speed limits introduced
OL,4,Ain two villages
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Cambridgeshire County Council
OL,7,Fspokesperson said: "The changes have
OL,8,Fbeen made in response to concerns
OL,9,Fraised locally and are intended to
OL,10,Fencourage lower vehicle speeds in
OL,11,Fresidential areas."
